<title>USA: Century Inds FY 96 revenues increase.</title>
<headline>Century Inds FY 96 revenues increase.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Century Industries Inc on Thursday said its revenues for the 11 months to November 30, 1996 were $12,646,000 compared with $2,700,000 for the comparable period in 1995.</p>
<p>The company said the increase was attributable to the acquisition of D.C. Partners in September 1996.</p>
<p>Net loss for the first 11 months of 1996 was $122,193, or $0.05 per share.</p>
<p>The company was not available to comment on comparative figures for 1995.</p>
</text>
